# PRTab EOS backend — bicubic-table PR (tabulated T(rho,e) forward solve
# with PR fallback outside the table domain / on guard rejection).
#
# This mirrors PR/Make.package.  PRTab carries its own copies of
# hem_pr_state.H and hem_saturation_amrex.H (do NOT add ../PR to the
# include path — both backends name their header EOS.H and an earlier
# -I would silently shadow this one).  The generated table sources
# (prtab_table_data.cpp / prtab_table_params.H) are git-ignored and
# built by `make tables` — see tools/.

CEXE_headers += EOS.H
CEXE_headers += prtab_bicubic.H
CEXE_headers += hem_pr_state.H
CEXE_headers += hem_saturation_amrex.H

# Table data (bicubic PR EOS) compiled ONCE here; prtab_bicubic.H only
# declares the arrays extern, so the widely-included header stays small.
CEXE_sources += prtab_table_data.cpp
